OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with further showers, heavy at
OL,7,Ftimes particularly in the north and
OL,8,Fwest, through the evening into
OL,9,FSaturday. Remaining windy through the
OL,10,Fnight, with strong gusts around the
OL,11,Fcoasts and hills. A more widely cool
OL,12,Fnight than last night.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FRemaining partly cloudy with
OL,15,Fshowers, heavy at times. Fresh to
OL,16,Fstrong winds, gusty around the coasts
OL,17,Fand hills. Showers and winds ease by
OL,18,Fthe evening. Feeling cool.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
